<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13229" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπομνημον-εύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>relate from memory,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				228a
			</span></i>, etc.:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be recorded,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπομνημονεύεται ὁπόστος ἐγένετο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Ages.</u>
					1.2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>remember, call to mind,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Plt.</u>
				268e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Phd.</u>
				103b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ly.</u>
				211a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				19.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				3.16
			</span></i>, etc.; <i>keep in mind,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διδαχήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Plt.</u>
					273b
				</span></i>
			,al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τούτου τὠυτὸ οὔνομα ἀπεμνημόνευσε
				τῷ παιδὶ θέσθαι</span>
			<i>gave</i> his son the same name <i>in memory of</i> a thing,
				<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.65
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τινί τι</span>
			<i>bear</i> something <i>in mind against</i> another, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				1.2.31
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				1.129
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				3.208
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδὲ μνησίκακος: οὐ γὰρ μεγαλοψύχου
					τὸ ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>EN</u>
					1125a4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί τι</span>
			<i>bear in mind favourably,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πατρικὰς εὐεργεσίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					3.19
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χάριν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Sacr.</u>
					2
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>JTr.</u>
				40
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
